## Third-Party Software, Data & Intellectual Property Attributions

EarthSphere incorporates and interfaces with the following open-source libraries, public data services, and geospatial platforms:

### 1. NASA Open APIs & Public Domain Data
- **Provider:** National Aeronautics and Space Administration (NASA).
- **APIs:** EONET v3, APOD, DONKI Space Weather, NeoWs Asteroids, DSCOVR EPIC, Mars Rover Photos, NASA Image & Video Library, Landsat Surface Reflectance, CNEOS Fireballs, TechPort.
- **License / Terms:** NASA data, photographs, and scientific datasets are in the public domain and provided under the [NASA Open Data Policy](https://www.nasa.gov/open/data.html).

### 2. God's Eye View (GEV) Tactical 3D Suite
- **Original Author:** Bilawal Sidhu ([@bilawalsidhu](https://github.com/bilawalsidhu/gods-eye-view)).
- **License:** MIT License.
- **Copyright:** (c) 2024-2026 Bilawal Sidhu. Included under MIT terms.

### 3. CesiumJS
- **Provider:** Cesium GS, Inc.
- **License:** Apache License, Version 2.0 ([https://github.com/CesiumGS/cesium/blob/main/LICENSE.md](https://github.com/CesiumGS/cesium/blob/main/LICENSE.md)).
- **Cesium ion & Google 3D Tiles:** Subject to the Cesium ion Terms of Service and Google Maps Platform Terms of Service.

### 4. MapLibre GL JS
- **Provider:** MapLibre Organization.
- **License:** BSD 3-Clause "New" or "Revised" License.
- **Copyright:** (c) 2020-2026 MapLibre contributors.

### 5. Three.js
- **Author:** Ricardo Cabello (Mr.doob) and Three.js authors.
- **License:** MIT License.
- **Copyright:** (c) 2010-2026 Three.js authors.

### 6. Real-Time Telemetry Providers
- **OpenSky Network & adsb.lol:** Global ADS-B aircraft vector streams provided for open-source research and educational usage.
- **AISStream:** Real-time global maritime vessel transponder streams via WebSockets.
- **CelesTrak:** Two-Line Element (TLE) satellite orbital mechanics and ephemerides provided courtesy of Dr. T.S. Kelso.
- **NASA FIRMS:** Active Fire Information for Resource Management System (VIIRS / MODIS satellite heat detection).

### 7. Core Frontend Frameworks
- **Next.js & React:** Copyright (c) Vercel, Inc. and Meta Platforms, Inc. (MIT License).
- **Tailwind CSS:** Copyright (c) Tailwind Labs, Inc. (MIT License).
- **Lucide Icons:** Copyright (c) Lucide Contributors (ISC License).

